<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Pancon year net profit A$15.11 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Pancon year net profit A$15.11 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    27.24 vs 16.44</p>
<p>    Net			    profit 15.11 vs loss 60.86</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)		nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Pancontinental Mining Ltd is about 87.2 percent owned by Goldfields Ltd.  </p>
<p>    Sales				  304.82 vs 292.16</p>
<p>    Other income			   9.73 vs 8.58</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			     6.2 vs loss 28.8</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			  nil vs loss 94.7</p>
<p>    Extraordinary items	 gain 153.26 vs nil</p>
<p>    Tax			   expense 12.12 vs credit 17.40</p>
<p>    Interest				11.40 vs 11.55</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  41.38 vs 59.65</p>
<p>    Minorities				nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Extraordinary gain reflects sale of company's non-gold assets during the year.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
</text>
